OL,3,GNEWSAWoman told 'nobody wants to see a
OL,4,Apregnant person' in work by her boss,
OL,5,Atribunal finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FA sales manager was discriminated
OL,8,Fagainst at work by being told "nobody
OL,9,Fwants to see a pregnant person" after
OL,10,Fshe offered to make a presentation to
OL,11,Fclients.
OL,13,FJessica Morgan was several months into
OL,14,Fher pregnancy when her boss at a wood
OL,15,Fpanelling firm allegedly "sniggered" at
OL,16,Fher suggestion that she would lead the
OL,17,Fsales pitch.
OL,19,FA tribunal in Swansea heard that the
OL,20,Fboss at Panelex Wood, Frederick Geraint
OL,21,FHawkes, denied making the comment about
OL,22,Fher pregnancy.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
