OL,3,GNEWSAWoman told 'nobody wants to see a
OL,4,Apregnant person' in work by her boss,
OL,5,Atribunal finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt found that while Morgan's pregnancy
OL,8,Fand maternity discrimination claim had
OL,9,Fbeen "well-founded", it was dismissed
OL,10,Fbecause of the amount of time it had
OL,11,Ftaken for her to bring it to them.
